SUMMARY:REPRISE: Recreating Iconic Phish Shows *Rescheduled Date*
DESCRIPTION:Thursday November 19th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $26.50 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID Required to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Mickey’s Black Box\n————————————————–\nREPRISE is a band that formed to *reprise* the Phish experience. \nHailing from New England\, the all-star band consists of: \nCal Kehoe\, longtime frontman for Pink Talking Fish\, helms the enterprise on guitar. Adrian Tramontano (Twiddle\, Kung Fu and The Breakfast) masters the drums. Scott Chasolen chairmans the boards for the project\, bringing years of experience as a founding member of Ulu and keyboardist of The Machine\, a Pink Floyd tribute.  Multi-instrumentalist and composer Chris DeAngelis (The Machine\, Kung Fu and The Breakfast) rounds out the foursome on bass.  \nThe time is near\, the mission’s clear — get ready to blaze on with REPRISE! \nCheck out Reprise here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/reprise-recreating-iconic-phish-shows/
